string.text:
ENERGETIK PALACE OF CULTURE
VOLUNTEER WORK SHEET

Help needed from city residents:

— finish the interior spaces;
— decorate the halls;
— prepare the stage;
— improve the surrounding grounds.

Work is to be performed after the regular shift ends.

Completion: ________________________________

%c[255,238,153,26]After it opened, the Palace of Culture ranked first in the Kyiv Region for leisure programming.%c[0,170,170,170]

FAKEL PEOPLE'S ENSEMBLE
REHEARSAL SHEET
Winter program, 1984

Number: traditional Christmas carols.

Before the next rehearsal:
— check the lyrics;
— assign the voices;
— confirm the performers;
— prepare the number for the Christmas season.

%c[255,238,153,26]Christmas carols entered the program of an official Palace of Culture in a Soviet nuclear city.%c[0,170,170,170]

PRIPYAT CITY PARK OF CULTURE AND RECREATION
FESTIVE OPENING PLAN

Opening date: May 1, 1986

Before opening:
— complete preparation of the grounds;
— inspect all installed rides;
— finish the holiday decorations;
— ensure the Ferris wheel and visitor areas are ready.

Notify the city's enterprises, schools, and institutions of the opening.

%c[255,238,153,26]The park was meant to welcome its first visitors on May Day.%c[0,170,170,170]
